OL,3,GNEWSAStatue of wandering Susie the cat
OL,4,Aunveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long-awaited statue of a beloved
OL,7,Froaming feline has been unveiled in a
OL,8,Ftown centre.
OL,10,FResidents, artists, writers, musicians
OL,11,Fand animal lovers in Dorchester,
OL,12,FDorset, gathered to celebrate Susie the
OL,13,Fcat, who has achieved local celebrity
OL,14,Fstatus by making herself at home in
OL,15,Fpubs, shops and supermarkets.
OL,17,FA bronze statue - depicting her as a
OL,18,FRoman-era cat as a nod to the town's
OL,19,Forigins - was created by sculptor Ama
OL,20,FMenec.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
