OL,3,GNEWSAStatue of wandering Susie the cat
OL,4,Aunveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Susie failed to make an
OL,7,Fappearance for the rain-soaked
OL,8,Fceremony, owner Jenny Graves said her
OL,9,Fpet "bonds the town together".
